    "descriptions": {
        "zh-CN": "靛蓝与朱红层带沿斜向河谷展开，细金线勾勒褶皱。低频推动主带，中频改变流形，高频增强金边；保留暗部留白、可编辑高度场与颜料 Shader、三宏和四段配乐。",
        "en-US": "Indigo and vermilion strata sweep across a diagonal valley with delicate gold edges. Bass drives the main band, mids reshape flow and highs light the edges. Editable height/pigment shaders, three macros and four music cues."
